+# Apply V43.16.0
+
+Replace the changed client/server files and add the eight new Executive AI modules included in this patch.
+
+Restart:
+
+```powershell
+taskkill /F /IM node.exe
+npm run start
+```
+
+Open:
+
+`http://localhost:8787/?pack=executive`
+
+Recommended order: Executive AI Console -> Executive Conversation Memory -> Executive Evidence Citations -> Governed Executive Action Draft -> Executive AI Readiness.
